WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.961
Where’s Jericho?

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:05.297
Why haven’t you told her?

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:07.591
They’ve taken Jericho.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.010
She’s not the sweet child you think she is.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:12.971
Where’s Jericho?

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:14.890
Leanne’s gone.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.226
She’s taken him.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.771
This family is divided.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.900
I don’t know what I believe.

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.486
We have to protect ourselves.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.863
They’ve been watching us?

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:32.491
Who are they? What do they want with us?

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:34.159
Why are you not frightened?

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:35.160
Of you?

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:36.203
Of her.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.663
Tell me where he is!

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:40.123
I wanna see her get what she deserves.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:44.169
This is too far.

00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:48.757
Nothing is too far.

